OL,3,GNEWSAAttempted murder arrest after man
OL,4,Ainjured in fight
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fattempted murder after another man
OL,8,Fsuffered a serious head injury in an
OL,9,Fassault in Bradford.
OL,11,FPolice were called to Brompton Road
OL,12,Fjust after 21:00 BST on Saturday to
OL,13,Freports a man had been injured with
OL,14,Fweapons during a fight in the street.
OL,16,FThe 59-year-old victim remains in
OL,17,Fhospital with life-threatening
OL,18,Finjuries, West Yorkshire Police said.
